The published Cargo manifest misspells two version keys. Cargo therefore
rejects it before TakoPack can apply a normal manifest overlay.

regenerate.sh verifies the published crate archive, applies Patch2000 to a
temporary source directory, and passes that directory through crate_src_path.
The source.url and source.sha256 configuration fields preserve the original
release archive in the generated Spec.

Those two configuration fields are implemented by
2001-Add-source-archive-overrides-to-TakoPack.patch, based on TakoPack commit
43d3ac3496aad36548da82f2e46bb79f6b59eecb. Apply that patch to the tool checkout
with git am and build it with cargo build --release --locked -p takopack.
Place the resulting takopack on PATH, then run:

    sh regenerate.sh /absolute/output/directory

Patch2001 is a generator patch. Only Patch2000 applies to the crate source.
